WEBVTT

01:25.800 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:35.720
LIULI PALACE

01:55.640 --> 01:57.400
Look! What is this?

02:04.400 --> 02:06.480
Don't use a shovel. Use something small.

02:06.560 --> 02:09.440
Dig together. Do not damage it.

02:18.000 --> 02:18.840
Be careful.

02:34.960 --> 02:36.600
LIULI PALACE

02:41.200 --> 02:43.000
Assistant Director, this is…

02:43.080 --> 02:45.800
What a treasure
buried beneath the Liuli Palace.

02:45.880 --> 02:47.080
Quick.

02:47.160 --> 02:49.040
Inform His Majesty at once.

02:58.400 --> 03:01.440
In two weeks,
Venus will appear during the day?

03:06.400 --> 03:07.360
I have news.

03:10.520 --> 03:13.560
Your Majesty,
Assistant Director Shen Chuan reported

03:14.160 --> 03:16.040
that he dug up a dragon statue
in Liuli Palace.

03:16.640 --> 03:18.400
This could be an auspicious sign.

03:18.480 --> 03:20.400
Please advise, Your Majesty.

03:29.760 --> 03:32.000
This… This doesn't seem like a dragon.

03:32.080 --> 03:33.000
This is…

03:34.480 --> 03:36.280
- It's a Hou beast.
- It's a Hou beast.

03:36.360 --> 03:39.000
The ancient beast that preys upon dragons.

03:39.080 --> 03:41.880
We dug up something incredible.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.200
Silence!

04:02.000 --> 04:03.000
Assistant Director!

04:05.800 --> 04:06.880
- Assistant Director!
- Assistant Director!

04:06.960 --> 04:08.240
Quick.

04:09.120 --> 04:10.160
- Oh my.
- He fainted.

04:10.240 --> 04:10.920
Careful. Come.

04:11.000 --> 04:12.160
- Quick.
- Careful.

04:14.360 --> 04:16.560
The appearance of Venus
is just a possible outcome,

04:16.640 --> 04:18.399
but it is never observed in our records.

04:18.480 --> 04:21.120
Yet the bamboo message
has made a serious allegation of it.

04:22.440 --> 04:23.360
Deputy Director Xiao,

04:23.440 --> 04:25.720
I've kept the bamboo message with me
after it was sealed.

04:25.800 --> 04:28.600
I never let my guard down
and will never alter the message myself.

04:28.680 --> 04:30.960
I know how meticulous you are,

04:31.040 --> 04:32.360
but from the time you submitted

04:32.440 --> 04:34.800
the bamboo message
to the time it reached His Majesty,

04:34.880 --> 04:35.960
someone might have tampered
with the message.

04:36.560 --> 04:38.600
Deputy Director Xiao, what do we do now?

04:39.280 --> 04:40.280
Even if it was tampered with,

04:40.360 --> 04:42.000
it is nonetheless negligence on my part.

04:42.080 --> 04:42.960
If His Majesty finds out…

04:43.040 --> 04:46.560
The culprit did this because he was sure
that His Majesty would never doubt it.

04:47.840 --> 04:49.160
I will explain to His Majesty personally.

04:50.240 --> 04:51.280
Go now.

04:53.600 --> 04:54.440
Mr. Xiao.

04:56.960 --> 04:58.560
Gu, are you here for the Venus?

04:58.640 --> 04:59.840
Yes.

04:59.920 --> 05:00.800
His Majesty asked
the Court of Judicial Review

05:00.880 --> 05:02.200
to investigate the source
of the nursery rhyme.

05:02.280 --> 05:03.120
It is a major event.

05:03.200 --> 05:04.800
The appearance of Venus

05:04.880 --> 05:07.360
is only one of the possible outcomes
according to our calculations.

05:07.440 --> 05:09.320
It doesn't mean it will happen,
and it's pending verification.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.840
The stars are always changing.

05:11.920 --> 05:13.360
The bamboo message
delivered to His Majesty

05:13.440 --> 05:14.920
omitted the other possibilities.

05:15.000 --> 05:17.680
The bamboo message was altered
by someone else after it was sent out

05:17.760 --> 05:19.120
from the Astronomical Bureau.

05:19.200 --> 05:21.320
The culprit has an agenda.

05:22.280 --> 05:26.440
But who is the intended victim here?

05:28.640 --> 05:29.520
Gu.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.440
Please tell the County Princess

05:31.960 --> 05:33.240
that these sudden cases

05:33.320 --> 05:35.920
and the nursery rhyme
do not come out of thin air.

05:36.760 --> 05:38.760
Perhaps their goal isn't
to sabotage the Grand Festival,

05:38.840 --> 05:42.200
but to harm Consort Shu
under the guise of astronomy.

05:42.280 --> 05:43.280
Mr. Xiao,

05:44.000 --> 05:45.640
why can't you tell her yourself?

05:50.800 --> 05:52.280
One is bound by the path of Heaven.

05:52.800 --> 05:54.600
The stars have their own trajectories.

05:55.120 --> 05:55.960
So do humans.

05:59.160 --> 06:01.680
ZICHEN HALL

06:06.960 --> 06:07.800
Your Majesty,

06:09.160 --> 06:11.200
the appearance of Venus
is only one of the possible outcomes

06:11.280 --> 06:12.760
according to our calculations.

06:12.840 --> 06:13.680
It doesn't mean it will happen.

06:14.320 --> 06:16.280
Even someone knowledgeable
like my master cannot predict it.

06:16.360 --> 06:18.680
Please do not be worried about it.

06:19.520 --> 06:20.760
Besides, the mortal affairs

06:20.840 --> 06:23.200
are not determined by the movements
of astrological bodies.

06:23.840 --> 06:25.040
They say

06:25.120 --> 06:27.680
when Venus appears during the day,
an Empress will rise.

06:27.760 --> 06:28.720
I know that.

06:29.560 --> 06:33.080
You once said
the stars would not wreak havoc,

06:33.160 --> 06:35.880
but people would use the stars
to create something out of nowhere.

06:36.480 --> 06:38.920
My concerns are not confined
to the stars solely.

06:39.000 --> 06:42.480
The Hou beast dug out
recently in the Liuli Palace

06:43.000 --> 06:44.080
is an ominous sign too.

06:44.840 --> 06:48.080
The Hou beast is indeed
a mythological beast.

06:48.160 --> 06:49.560
But the discovery of an ancient artifact

06:49.640 --> 06:51.440
can be interpreted as a harbinger of doom

06:51.520 --> 06:53.600
or a remnant from the previous dynasty.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.520
Many things have happened lately,

06:58.600 --> 07:00.360
and the Grand Festival
is around the corner.

07:00.440 --> 07:03.240
I do not want to see another accident.

07:03.320 --> 07:04.640
Yes.

07:41.760 --> 07:42.880
Your Ladyship!

07:51.760 --> 07:52.920
Your Ladyship.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.560
Your Ladyship.

07:56.680 --> 07:58.960
The ladder has been oiled. It's slippery.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.760
I suppose that's why
the Assistant Director fell down.

08:01.360 --> 08:02.920
The ladder is in an odd spot.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.720
Where was the ladder originally?

08:04.800 --> 08:08.520
Sir, the ladder
was in the corner over there.

08:08.600 --> 08:11.200
Somehow, someone moved it here.

08:11.800 --> 08:14.600
Many people walk past there.
It is a nuisance.

08:14.680 --> 08:17.160
Someone deliberately put it here.

08:17.240 --> 08:19.480
Who knows how many people
have touched this ladder?

08:19.560 --> 08:21.120
We won't be able
to identify who oiled it up.

08:21.200 --> 08:22.840
Just who is trying to sabotage
the Grand Festival?

08:24.400 --> 08:25.480
Your Ladyship, are you aware

08:25.560 --> 08:27.400
of the nursery rhyme
that came from the city recently?

08:27.480 --> 08:29.840
"Five, four, three, two, one.
Fire, water, earth, wood, metal.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.360
As Venus soars above ground,

08:31.440 --> 08:33.120
the divine beast's roar
silences the dragon.

08:33.200 --> 08:36.280
When Venus descends upon the palace,
the world will know true peace."

08:37.600 --> 08:41.080
Is the Hou beast the divine beast
in the nursery rhyme?

08:41.159 --> 08:42.120
Yes.

08:42.960 --> 08:43.880
And not only that.

08:43.960 --> 08:46.400
The nursery rhyme
is accompanied by a rumor

08:46.480 --> 08:49.960
that when Consort Shu was born,
Venus appeared during the day.

08:50.040 --> 08:51.080
And they say it will happen again.

08:52.160 --> 08:54.920
So you're saying the nursery rhyme,
the rumor, and the Hou beast

08:55.000 --> 08:57.080
aren't trying to sabotage
the Grand Festival,

08:57.160 --> 08:58.000
but Consort Shu.

09:09.480 --> 09:11.240
Assistant Director. You're awake.

09:11.320 --> 09:14.040
But you're heavily injured.
Why are you here?

09:14.120 --> 09:16.080
That's right.
Your health is more important.

09:16.160 --> 09:19.880
I almost committed a grave error
due to my negligence.

09:21.000 --> 09:24.960
I must supervise the project personally
to make sure nothing can go wrong.

09:25.520 --> 09:26.880
Besides,

09:27.600 --> 09:30.200
the one who tried
to harm me is still here.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.120
I can't let him get away.

09:33.120 --> 09:34.280
Continue.

09:35.800 --> 09:36.840
Why did you stop?

09:41.720 --> 09:42.920
Assistant Director, you're awake.

09:44.640 --> 09:47.720
But you should go back and recuperate.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.320
It's you!

09:50.280 --> 09:52.120
You misled me by saying
the Hou beast was a dragon.

09:52.840 --> 09:55.560
You wanted to kill me
to usurp my position.

09:55.640 --> 09:58.000
Assistant Director, why would you say so?

09:58.080 --> 10:00.840
I found the statue first.

10:00.920 --> 10:03.920
I thought we should dig it up first
before we tell His Majesty.

10:04.000 --> 10:05.840
But you were eager to take credit

10:05.920 --> 10:08.160
and decided to inform His Majesty
before we excavated the whole thing.

10:08.240 --> 10:10.920
How could you blame me
and even frame me for that?

10:11.000 --> 10:12.720
You're denying it.

10:13.480 --> 10:15.680
I've seen through you
for a long time already.

10:15.760 --> 10:16.840
This isn't recent.

10:16.920 --> 10:17.920
You…

10:18.000 --> 10:20.080
Given your state of injuries,
I will let this slide.

10:20.160 --> 10:23.360
Remember the Flower on the Wall?
Your craftiness backfired on you.

10:23.440 --> 10:25.600
This time, instead of learning
from your past mistakes,

10:25.680 --> 10:28.440
you were keen to impress
His Majesty to earn his favor.

10:28.520 --> 10:30.160
That is why you end up in this situation.

10:30.240 --> 10:31.560
His Majesty knows
that you are heavily injured,

10:31.640 --> 10:32.800
so he decided not to punish you yet.

10:32.880 --> 10:36.760
Instead of repenting,
you came here yelling and framing me.

10:37.680 --> 10:41.160
You… You… I'll kill you!

10:41.800 --> 10:43.600
- I…
- Calm down.

10:43.680 --> 10:44.880
Calm down.

10:44.960 --> 10:47.080
- Let go of me.
- See if he has the guts to hit me.

10:47.160 --> 10:48.920
Calm down. Calm down, Assistant Director.

11:22.680 --> 11:24.360
IF YOU WANT TO KNOW WHO TRIED TO KILL YOU

11:24.440 --> 11:26.200
MEET ME AT LIULI PALACE EAST GARDEN
TONIGHT, AT THE HOUR OF CHOU

11:55.760 --> 11:58.240
LIULI PALACE

11:59.200 --> 12:00.560
Dirty tricks.

12:02.000 --> 12:03.200
He used sand to blind me.

12:07.440 --> 12:10.040
YU SHISHUN

12:10.680 --> 12:11.560
Yu Shishun.

12:12.160 --> 12:13.000
I knew it was you.

12:16.480 --> 12:19.160
We already locked Yu Shishun up.
He refused to answer our questions.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.480
Mr. Xiao,

12:20.560 --> 12:23.200
how did you figure out
that Yu Shishun is the culprit?

12:24.560 --> 12:27.280
I wasn't very certain either.
It was just my speculation.

12:27.360 --> 12:30.040
Initially, I assumed Lisheng
died from the iron caltrops

12:30.120 --> 12:31.480
because iron caltrops were used.

12:32.080 --> 12:33.560
But as I ruminate over the nursery rhyme,

12:33.640 --> 12:35.440
I realized the fire
was the key to the puzzle.

12:35.520 --> 12:37.240
The culprit must be present at the scene

12:37.320 --> 12:39.040
and is aware of the palace's layout.

12:39.120 --> 12:40.840
He can come and go
without raising suspicion

12:40.920 --> 12:42.360
and is probably preparing
the Grand Festival.

12:42.440 --> 12:44.760
But that doesn't mean it's Yu Shishun.

12:45.320 --> 12:47.880
The craftsmen, palace maids, musicians.
There are a lot of people.

12:47.960 --> 12:49.240
That's why I asked you

12:49.320 --> 12:51.520
to disguise as Shen Chuan tonight
and attend the rendezvous.

12:51.600 --> 12:53.360
I want to lure out the culprit
to confirm my speculation.

12:53.440 --> 12:54.760
Speculation?

12:54.840 --> 12:56.000
The time.

12:57.480 --> 13:00.360
That's right. I've always had a theory.

13:00.920 --> 13:04.000
I believe the culprit is obsessed
with the five stars

13:04.080 --> 13:05.600
and the five elements.

13:05.680 --> 13:08.440
The two previous cases have
matching elements and stars' positions.

13:08.520 --> 13:11.120
It wasn't until tonight's incident
that I can say for certain

13:11.200 --> 13:12.280
that not only is the culprit obsessed

13:12.360 --> 13:13.520
with the five elements
and the stars' position,

13:13.600 --> 13:15.680
the time of his criminal activity
is related to the five elements too.

13:16.280 --> 13:17.880
- The hour of Chou.
- That's right.

13:18.440 --> 13:20.760
Lisheng died at the hour of Si,
matching the fire element.

13:20.840 --> 13:23.040
Su Zhuo'er died at the hour of Zi,
matching the water element.

13:23.680 --> 13:25.360
Shen Chuan fell down at the hour of Wei.

13:25.440 --> 13:27.400
But the culprit
didn't expect him to survive.

13:27.480 --> 13:30.760
So we had Shen Chuan make a scene
in the Liuli Palace.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.480
And indeed, the culprit picked

13:32.560 --> 13:34.240
the hour of Chou, matching
the earth element, to commit his crime.

13:34.960 --> 13:37.080
The culprit is knowledgeable
about the stars and the five elements.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.080
He is obsessed with time

13:38.160 --> 13:40.000
and is someone
who can come and go with ease

13:40.080 --> 13:41.440
as we prepare for the Grand Festival.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.400
The Imperial Time Logger
in charge of the water clock

13:43.480 --> 13:44.320
is the most suspicious.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.520
An Imperial Time Logger
isn't that powerful.

13:47.320 --> 13:48.680
That means he has a mastermind.

13:49.720 --> 13:52.200
Yu Shishun has served
longer than I have in the bureau.

13:52.280 --> 13:53.480
He slowly climbed from the position
of a water-clock apprentice.

13:53.560 --> 13:56.600
It's not far-fetched to assume
that he might collude with someone

13:56.680 --> 13:57.560
whom I do not know.

13:58.720 --> 14:01.160
Your Ladyship,
Yu Shishun pleaded for leniency.

14:01.240 --> 14:02.720
He said if Your Ladyship
could save his family,

14:02.800 --> 14:04.240
he would confess everything.

14:06.560 --> 14:07.560
Your Ladyship.

14:08.720 --> 14:09.560
Your Ladyship.

14:10.560 --> 14:13.400
Your Ladyship. Please save my family.

14:13.480 --> 14:16.320
Celestial Lord said tonight

14:16.400 --> 14:17.840
was my last chance.

14:17.920 --> 14:19.880
- Celestial Lord? Who?
- Celestial Lord…

14:21.680 --> 14:24.760
My house is at Chongren Ward,
Southwest Corner, Jia Alley, Chen Lot.

14:25.680 --> 14:28.200
Chongren Ward, Southwest Corner,
Jia Alley, Chen Lot.

14:28.280 --> 14:30.840
Your Ladyship!
Your Ladyship, save my family!

14:30.920 --> 14:31.880
Your Ladyship!

14:31.960 --> 14:34.600
YU'S MANSION

14:39.800 --> 14:41.000
We're too late.

14:50.240 --> 14:51.080
They are dead.

14:52.000 --> 14:52.840
What happened here?

14:53.920 --> 14:55.640
Be careful. The culprit
might still be here.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.240
He has killed so many people.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.560
If we interrogate him,
he'll give in easily.

14:58.640 --> 15:00.320
I'll search the ward with my men.

15:00.400 --> 15:01.560
- Follow me.
- Yes.

15:03.440 --> 15:04.280
Follow me.

15:08.880 --> 15:12.800
Five, four, three, two, one

15:17.080 --> 15:20.760
Fire, water, earth, wood, metal

15:30.400 --> 15:32.080
YU LAN'ER, YU'S SON

15:32.160 --> 15:37.400
As Venus soars above ground

15:39.200 --> 15:43.720
The divine beast's roars
Silences the dragon

15:43.800 --> 15:49.760
When Venus descends upon the palace

15:50.480 --> 15:55.040
The world will know true peace

15:58.040 --> 15:58.880
Your Ladyship,

15:59.600 --> 16:00.720
in addition to the three servants
by the door,

16:00.800 --> 16:02.640
Yu Shishun's wife, parents,

16:02.720 --> 16:04.880
and two other maids are all dead.

16:07.640 --> 16:09.160
Bring this child back
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.240
Ask Yudi to examine him.

16:10.320 --> 16:11.480
Yes.

16:34.080 --> 16:35.360
- Celestial Lord.
- Celestial Lord.

16:56.640 --> 16:57.480
Have some tea, Celestial Lord.

17:25.400 --> 17:27.280
- Mercy, Celestial Lord.
- Mercy, Celestial Lord.

17:32.880 --> 17:33.920
Did you find anything,
Deputy Director Xiao?

17:34.680 --> 17:36.320
The water is still warm. He has just left.

17:36.400 --> 17:37.840
It's curfew now.

17:37.920 --> 17:39.000
So he probably is still in Chongren Ward.

17:39.080 --> 17:39.920
What does he look like?

17:41.000 --> 17:42.680
Tall. He can fight.

17:43.880 --> 17:44.720
He's in white.

17:46.840 --> 17:49.040
But he probably has changed his robe.

17:50.080 --> 17:51.800
He's not thin. From an ordinary household.

18:08.200 --> 18:10.160
There isn't much information.
Identifying him will be difficult.

18:11.000 --> 18:12.040
All right.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.760
I'll inform Prosecutor Gu right away.

18:25.040 --> 18:27.400
They died recently.
The culprit is probably nearby.

18:27.480 --> 18:30.360
Your Ladyship, Deputy Director Xiao
said the same thing too.

18:30.440 --> 18:31.680
I am heading to Prosecutor Gu now.

18:32.280 --> 18:34.720
They died from a needle that pierced
through the back of their brain.

18:34.800 --> 18:37.000
The culprit is therefore a martial artist,
and a strong one at that.

18:37.080 --> 18:39.520
You there, follow Ma Xiaoran and assist
Prosecutor Gu in locating the culprit.

18:39.600 --> 18:40.760
- Yes.
- Yes.

18:43.400 --> 18:45.600
Your Ladyship.
The victim here is different.

18:46.760 --> 18:48.920
Everyone else died from the needle
that pierced their brain.

18:49.520 --> 18:51.480
But this one died to a blade.

18:52.840 --> 18:54.520
Oily fingers.

18:54.600 --> 18:55.840
Alcoholic stench.

18:56.760 --> 18:57.640
Facing the courtyard.

18:58.720 --> 19:00.360
He snuck out at night to drink.

19:00.960 --> 19:03.240
And when he came back,
he bumped into the culprit.

19:03.320 --> 19:05.920
Before he could run away,
a blade took his life.

19:06.000 --> 19:09.280
The culprit killed the witness
yet spared the child.

19:10.760 --> 19:12.960
He wanted the child
to sing the nursery rhyme.

19:13.040 --> 19:15.120
But what if the child manages
to describe his appearance?

19:17.320 --> 19:19.640
Or could this be a deliberate act?

19:29.440 --> 19:30.560
The child is young.

19:30.640 --> 19:32.440
He might not be able
to describe everything.

19:32.520 --> 19:34.120
Many plants here are burned too,

19:34.200 --> 19:36.560
creating smoke that obscured his face.

19:45.760 --> 19:47.080
There is also a small amount
of black powder.

19:53.360 --> 19:54.680
Shell of a flash bomb.

19:54.760 --> 19:57.320
No ordinary family
will burn plants to create smoke.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.240
The culprit probably did this.

19:59.440 --> 20:00.800
Yu Shishun called him the Celestial Lord.

20:00.880 --> 20:04.800
He probably used this to scare others.

20:04.880 --> 20:09.880
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

20:22.720 --> 20:23.600
There, there.

20:25.560 --> 20:26.880
What is your name?

20:30.240 --> 20:31.520
Yu… Yu Lan'er.

20:31.600 --> 20:33.840
What did you see last night?

20:37.800 --> 20:38.640
Don't cry.

20:45.760 --> 20:48.440
What does your family murderer look like?

20:51.760 --> 20:52.600
Your Ladyship,

20:52.680 --> 20:55.080
you can't ask a child questions like that.

20:55.720 --> 20:56.560
What do I do then?

21:16.920 --> 21:18.120
Really?

21:18.840 --> 21:19.880
You're not bluffing, are you?

21:20.480 --> 21:23.880
I'm not. I did see a deity.

21:28.840 --> 21:31.240
When I was playing
hide and seek with Wang Ahu,

21:31.960 --> 21:33.600
I hid inside the rice barrel.

21:35.600 --> 21:38.080
But he's so dumb.

21:38.160 --> 21:42.040
He couldn't find me.
I fell asleep accidentally.

21:42.120 --> 21:43.400
Later,

21:44.040 --> 21:46.640
there was thunder and lightning.

21:46.720 --> 21:48.320
It woke me up.

21:48.840 --> 21:51.680
When I came out, it was already dark.

21:52.280 --> 21:54.400
Mother and Madam Wang weren't there.

21:54.480 --> 21:55.840
I was hungry.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.160
Mercy, Celestial Lord.

21:57.240 --> 21:58.800
- Mercy.
- Mercy, Celestial Lord.

21:58.880 --> 22:00.880
I heard Grandfather
saying, "Celestial Lord".

22:00.960 --> 22:03.360
Father always told me
about the Celestial Lord.

22:03.440 --> 22:06.720
He said Celestial Lord was a deity
who could do anything.

22:07.480 --> 22:09.760
I wanted to see what he looked like.

22:09.840 --> 22:12.840
The deity was so powerful.

22:12.920 --> 22:14.520
He walked on mist.

22:24.960 --> 22:26.280
Did you see everything?

22:28.600 --> 22:30.000
Why didn't you run?

22:30.600 --> 22:31.560
I…

22:31.640 --> 22:34.040
I want to learn techniques from you.

22:37.480 --> 22:41.000
Sure. Let me teach you the chant.

22:41.640 --> 22:42.600
Remember it well.

22:43.360 --> 22:44.920
I'll only say it once.

22:46.480 --> 22:49.720
Five, four, three, two, one

22:50.520 --> 22:53.080
Fire, water, earth, wood, metal

22:53.160 --> 22:55.960
Five, four, three, two, one

22:56.520 --> 22:58.840
Fire, water, earth, wood, metal

22:59.600 --> 23:02.400
As Venus soars above ground

23:02.480 --> 23:05.880
The divine beast's roars
Silences the dragon

23:06.480 --> 23:09.440
As Venus soars above ground

23:10.040 --> 23:13.160
The divine beast's roars
Silences the dragon

23:21.080 --> 23:22.480
What's with the smoke?

23:23.240 --> 23:24.320
Where are they?

23:25.120 --> 23:26.200
Don't tell me there's another fire.

23:37.440 --> 23:39.200
A murder. A murder!

23:39.280 --> 23:40.560
A murder! A murder!

23:54.320 --> 23:56.160
And lastly.

23:56.920 --> 23:59.600
When Venus descends upon the palace

23:59.680 --> 24:02.880
The world will know true peace

24:06.080 --> 24:06.920
Repeat it.

24:07.840 --> 24:12.880
When Venus descends upon the palace

24:13.560 --> 24:17.400
The world will know true peace

24:20.200 --> 24:22.840
Remember it well. Do not forget.

24:22.920 --> 24:24.440
If you forget it,

24:25.560 --> 24:27.560
you'll end up like them.

24:41.040 --> 24:44.200
So, the Celestial Lord killed them.

24:44.800 --> 24:48.400
Then, he turned into stars and vanished.

24:50.760 --> 24:52.480
He turned into stars and vanished?

24:58.800 --> 24:59.960
Mother is dead.

25:00.760 --> 25:01.680
Grandfather is dead.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.760
Grandmother is dead.

25:06.640 --> 25:08.440
He has said enough.

25:09.120 --> 25:11.080
Let him rest. Take good care of him.

25:22.320 --> 25:23.280
Your Ladyship,

25:23.880 --> 25:25.680
he is the only person
who has seen the Celestial Lord.

25:25.760 --> 25:27.280
The more he recalls,

25:27.360 --> 25:29.120
the more likely we are
to find the culprit.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.800
But the more he recalls,

25:32.320 --> 25:34.040
the more pain he'll suffer.

25:34.760 --> 25:35.800
I'm sorry.

25:36.640 --> 25:38.240
Did it remind you of your past?

25:40.800 --> 25:42.120
No, it's on me.

25:43.360 --> 25:45.160
If I had been more thorough,

25:45.840 --> 25:47.760
Yu Shishun's family
wouldn't have been dead.

25:48.840 --> 25:50.560
He wouldn't have had to go through this.

25:51.760 --> 25:53.200
Now, he's like me.

25:54.080 --> 25:57.160
He will live through
this nightmare forever.

25:57.240 --> 25:58.400
That's not true.

25:59.720 --> 26:00.640
Boss,

26:01.160 --> 26:03.120
what happened 15 years ago
wasn't your fault.

26:03.200 --> 26:05.640
The death of the Yu family
isn't your fault either.

26:14.840 --> 26:15.920
Thank you.

26:18.360 --> 26:21.240
Then, let's find the culprit.

26:22.880 --> 26:24.320
- Let's go.
- Where to?

26:25.480 --> 26:28.520
Yu Lan'er isn't the only one
who saw the Celestial Lord.

26:28.600 --> 26:29.640
His father saw him too.

26:43.000 --> 26:45.000
I searched everywhere in Chongren Ward

26:45.720 --> 26:46.800
and asked everything I could.

26:47.520 --> 26:49.640
No one saw the Celestial Lord.

26:50.360 --> 26:54.240
Did he truly turn into a star
and fly away like the child said he did?

27:08.320 --> 27:11.480
The culprit put in a lot of effort
for his spectacle.

27:11.560 --> 27:12.760
But it's not difficult.

27:14.360 --> 27:16.760
Place some plants around the courtyard.

27:16.840 --> 27:19.440
Put a candle on that table.

27:21.240 --> 27:23.240
Hang a copper mirror over there.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.400
Quick. Get it done.

27:25.480 --> 27:26.400
- Yes.
- Yes.

27:27.120 --> 27:28.760
He must have done something

27:28.840 --> 27:31.080
to convince Yu Shishun's family
that he is the Celestial Lord

27:31.160 --> 27:32.520
and made them fear him.

27:33.040 --> 27:34.120
That way,

27:34.840 --> 27:37.800
it's not difficult for him
to burn some plants

27:37.880 --> 27:39.280
and have a copper mirror hung.

27:39.360 --> 27:41.640
He can just say that it's all

27:42.240 --> 27:44.280
to dispel evil spirits.

28:12.200 --> 28:14.360
And that's not difficult?

28:14.440 --> 28:17.400
If an adult sees this,
the cover will be blown.

28:17.920 --> 28:20.360
But he picked a traumatized child
as his witness.

28:20.440 --> 28:22.680
That will establish his identity
as the Celestial Lord easily.

28:23.320 --> 28:25.120
But Chongren Ward
is mostly occupied by officials,

28:25.200 --> 28:26.120
not citizens.

28:26.760 --> 28:29.160
If someone is staying here,
others will notice.

28:29.240 --> 28:31.280
But I searched the whole night

28:31.360 --> 28:33.000
and even asked every household here.

28:33.080 --> 28:34.360
No one saw any suspicious person.

28:34.440 --> 28:36.200
What if he lives in the ward?

28:39.240 --> 28:40.080
Right.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.360
No ordinary person can spread

28:42.440 --> 28:44.360
a nursery rhyme like this.

28:44.960 --> 28:47.720
But that only makes it
more difficult to investigate.

28:48.440 --> 28:49.360
Unless we have a portrait.

28:49.880 --> 28:53.360
But among the ones
who saw him, one is too young.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.680
And one is…

29:11.160 --> 29:12.600
Stay away!

29:12.680 --> 29:14.160
I don't know anything.

29:14.240 --> 29:16.840
I don't know anything.
I don't know anything.

29:16.920 --> 29:19.000
- He's like this after the hour of Chou.
- I don't know anything.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.080
Yu Shishun.

29:20.160 --> 29:23.080
Tell me who the Celestial Lord is
and I'll avenge your family.

29:24.000 --> 29:24.960
Avenge?

29:25.840 --> 29:26.720
Avenge?

29:29.520 --> 29:33.200
The Celestial Lord will kill you and me.

29:33.280 --> 29:34.840
You're safe here.

29:34.920 --> 29:37.240
He can't kill you or find you.

29:38.520 --> 29:39.960
You don't know him.

29:40.040 --> 29:43.120
Wherever I go, he always finds me.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.840
It's been 15 years!

29:44.920 --> 29:47.000
And he still found me.

29:47.880 --> 29:48.720
Why is he looking for you?

29:49.520 --> 29:52.160
- I did a bad thing.
- What bad thing?

29:52.240 --> 29:55.160
I… I…

29:58.800 --> 30:00.960
- Do you recognize this?
- Lan'er.

30:02.040 --> 30:02.920
Lan'er!

30:03.000 --> 30:05.360
- Lan'er!
- If you want him to live,

30:05.440 --> 30:07.840
tell me what you did.

30:08.440 --> 30:10.280
No, I won't tell you.

30:10.360 --> 30:12.000
I can't. Or I'll die.

30:12.080 --> 30:14.840
Tell me, and I'll let you see your son.

30:15.440 --> 30:18.440
If not, you'll see your child
in the afterlife.

30:18.520 --> 30:19.600
I can't tell you.

30:20.120 --> 30:22.840
I can't tell you, or I'll die.

30:23.640 --> 30:25.880
County Princess, if you interrogate him
further, he'll die for real.

30:26.480 --> 30:28.280
County Princess? County…

30:29.760 --> 30:31.720
You are the County Princess?

30:32.560 --> 30:34.880
You are Li Peiyi?

30:34.960 --> 30:36.800
You are Li Peiyi?

30:37.680 --> 30:39.000
You are working with him!

30:39.080 --> 30:40.720
What are you on about?

30:40.800 --> 30:43.120
You want to kill me.

30:45.600 --> 30:46.560
You want to kill me.

30:46.640 --> 30:50.000
Don't kill me. Don't kill me. Please.

30:50.520 --> 30:53.400
Don't kill me. Don't kill me…

30:56.120 --> 30:57.400
What do we do now?

30:59.000 --> 30:59.840
He's still alive.

31:07.200 --> 31:08.120
Where is the child?

31:08.200 --> 31:09.560
In the rear court.

31:15.040 --> 31:17.600
Die. Die. Die.

31:17.680 --> 31:18.640
Die.

31:19.240 --> 31:20.800
Die. Die.

31:22.120 --> 31:23.760
Lan'er. What are you doing?

31:24.440 --> 31:28.240
I want to kill the Celestial Lord
to avenge my family.

31:46.840 --> 31:48.920
That smell won't scare me anymore.

31:49.440 --> 31:51.160
It'll be the taste of my revenge!

31:51.240 --> 31:53.680
But I'm afraid you'll have new nightmares.

31:53.760 --> 31:55.640
I'm afraid he'll drag you down to hell.

31:56.320 --> 31:57.760
Why wouldn't you let me kill him?

31:58.920 --> 31:59.760
Why?

32:01.040 --> 32:03.480
I don't want you to live
with the pain of killing.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.920
You're not a monster

32:06.640 --> 32:09.400
who can kill and still sleep at night.

32:20.480 --> 32:21.320
Lan'er.

32:21.400 --> 32:24.600
Killing isn't the only way
to have your vengeance.

32:24.680 --> 32:28.160
I will find the killer
and make sure he is punished.

32:28.240 --> 32:29.440
And you

32:30.040 --> 32:33.200
shouldn't see vengeance
as your life purpose.

32:33.800 --> 32:35.640
But he killed my mother.

32:36.360 --> 32:37.920
And I don't know where my father is.

32:38.960 --> 32:40.280
I'm all

32:41.120 --> 32:42.800
that's left.

32:45.320 --> 32:47.680
But if you fill your life with vengeance,

32:48.280 --> 32:50.080
you will hurt those who love you.

32:53.840 --> 32:55.360
Look at your small hands.

32:55.440 --> 32:58.120
If you grab the dagger of vengeance,

32:58.840 --> 33:00.600
there will be no room left for the one
who loves you to hold your hands.

33:04.160 --> 33:06.760
There was a vendetta in me
for 15 years too.

33:07.920 --> 33:10.400
When I finally could kill the killer,

33:11.440 --> 33:12.800
someone stopped me.

33:12.880 --> 33:14.920
I resented him,

33:15.000 --> 33:16.120
blamed him,

33:17.120 --> 33:18.360
and even hated him.

33:20.480 --> 33:21.800
But looking at you now,

33:22.680 --> 33:24.520
I understand why he did what he did.

33:26.440 --> 33:27.360
Lan'er.

33:27.440 --> 33:29.400
Do not let hatred consume you.

33:30.080 --> 33:32.680
Do not let your enemy ruin your life.

33:32.760 --> 33:34.400
What should I do then?

33:36.040 --> 33:38.280
Can you describe
the Celestial Lord's appearance to us?

33:38.360 --> 33:40.920
I can avenge you without the dagger.

33:44.840 --> 33:45.880
Let's go.
